 "text": "Hi, how are you doing? Not really rude, but it' worth telling your close friends. You can ask for a room free dessert, or eat only before coming. The bride should be understanding. No problem. It just says yes or no about whether you can eat at all. Then you tell them about eating before or having a dessert later. Most brides will understand. Having it in your bag is ready, so best to ask the bride before it leaves your room. Lots of people are. The quick check before going in usually shows people are careful, and you always get the hero's welcome.",
